# book.jornaevents.com — redirects only (2026-10-29).
#
# The client app moved to jornaevents.com/client, beside the vendor app, so
# one site and one sign-in serve both (see docs/DECISIONS.md). This project
# stays attached to book.jornaevents.com only so every old link — bookmarks,
# emails already sent, the App Store listing — still lands on the same page
# at its new address. 301: the move is permanent. Pages keeps the query
# string on a redirect, so ?id=, ?t= and the like survive.
#
# Order matters; first match wins. The old seller pages come first because
# they went to the vendor app, not the client app.

# The seller pages moved to the vendor app on jornaevents.com (the jorna-vendor
# repo) and are gone from here. Old bookmarks and links go to the same page
# there. 301: they aren't coming back.
/app/my-dashboard       https://jornaevents.com/app/overview/            301
/app/my-dashboard/*     https://jornaevents.com/app/overview/            301
/app/my-bookings        https://jornaevents.com/app/my-bookings/         301
/app/my-bookings/*      https://jornaevents.com/app/my-bookings/         301
/app/my-calendar        https://jornaevents.com/app/my-calendar/         301
/app/my-calendar/*      https://jornaevents.com/app/my-calendar/         301
/app/my-availability    https://jornaevents.com/app/my-calendar/         301
/app/my-availability/*  https://jornaevents.com/app/my-calendar/         301
/app/my-earnings        https://jornaevents.com/app/my-earnings/         301
/app/my-earnings/*      https://jornaevents.com/app/my-earnings/         301
/app/vendor-profile     https://jornaevents.com/app/vendor-profile/      301
/app/vendor-profile/*   https://jornaevents.com/app/vendor-profile/      301
/app/vendor-onboarding  https://jornaevents.com/app/vendor-onboarding/   301
/app/vendor-onboarding/* https://jornaevents.com/app/vendor-onboarding/  301
/app/calendar-connected   https://jornaevents.com/app/calendar-connected/ 301
/app/calendar-connected/* https://jornaevents.com/app/calendar-connected/ 301
/app/vendor/stripe-onboard/*  https://jornaevents.com/app/vendor/stripe-onboard/:splat 301

# Everything else the app served, to the same page at its new address.
/app                    https://jornaevents.com/client/                  301
/app/*                  https://jornaevents.com/client/:splat            301
/help                   https://jornaevents.com/help/                    301
/help/*                 https://jornaevents.com/help/:splat              301
/                       https://jornaevents.com/client/                  301
